## Model Identity and Background

**Developer:** Moonshot AI (Chinese AI company)
**Release Date:** 2026
**Series:** Kimi (Kimi K2.5)
**Predecessor:** Kimi K2 or earlier
**License:** Proprietary (with open-source options for some variants)
