Kimi is Moonshot AI's family of large language models, developed by their research team. The K2.5 represents the latest in this series, with "K2.5" indicating the version. Moonshot AI is a Chinese AI research company with strong expertise in natural language processing and large language models, competing against other Chinese models like Qwen, DeepSeek, and Zhipu AI.

